                                                "sense_id": "3e064937-2c38-3bc6-9b01-3e720c28453e",
                                                "text": "We have more fun and exciting fundraisers planned, and we're trying to carefully budget them so they don't cut into your life savings. As they formalize, we'll widely publicize these events."
